度\t点缀色必须 完全不透明 (100% Opacity) 以制造跳跃感，背景保持暗沉无光。\n光影表现： 统一斜向光源（西北 45°），阴影柔和，层次清晰，自投影略浅于落影，边缘柔化。\n肌理表现： 道路、广场、绿地灰度区分明显，纹理自然、线条细腻。\n配景点缀： 以少量人物剪影、车辆、树木符号作为比例与场景点景，增强空间叙事与生活气息。\n视角设定： 微倾鸟瞰或轴测视角，强调空间深度与设计层次。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "mode": 2, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [665.018310546875, 418.58056640625], "pos": [28.910953521728516, 1599.070068359375], "id": 60, "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-ns", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "3.0.1", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [168], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 88, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "flags": {}, "type": "FluxKontextImageScale", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [336.4862060546875, 61.36616516113281], "pos": [1844.4049072265625, 2194.5224609375], "id": 62, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.50", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "FluxKontextImageScale", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 12}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": ["ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 96, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图片"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [1642.454345703125, 1451.3179931640625], "pos": [-1971.9979248046875, 180.3885498046875], "id": 67, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": fa